1f:["$","div",null,{"className":"site-shell content-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"content-main","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"editorial-contact","children":["Published by ",["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/editorial-policy/","children":"AspireCompass Editorial Team"}]," · Editorial contact: ",["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/team/hafiz-umar-farooq/","children":"Hafiz Umar Farooq"}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"quick-answer","aria-labelledby":"quick-answer-title","children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"quick-answer-title","children":"The short answer"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The reviewed DESY application page is closed and still names the 2026 programme. No 2027 call was verified. Prepare your research-fit evidence now, then check the next named official call for its actual dates, conditions and support."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"answer-next","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Next step:"}]," ","Complete one row of the research-fit worksheet and ask your university how it can certify enrolment over the full period of a future placement."]}],"$undefined"]}],"$undefined",false,false,false,null,["$","details",null,{"className":"mobile-contents","children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":"On this page: jump to your answer"}],["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"Article sections","children":[["$","a","What is verified, and what is still unknown",{"href":"#section-1","children":"What is verified, and what is still unknown"}],["$","a","Research fit: translate a skill into an observable task",{"href":"#section-2","children":"Research fit: translate a skill into an observable task"}],["$","a","Build a compact evidence folder before writing a motivation statement",{"href":"#section-3","children":"Build a compact evidence folder before writing a motivation statement"}],["$","a","Check enrolment continuity before assuming a summer is available",{"href":"#section-4","children":"Check enrolment continuity before assuming a summer is available"}],["$","a","Separate supported costs from money needed before arrival",{"href":"#section-5","children":"Separate supported costs from money needed before arrival"}],["$","a","When a new call appears, rebuild the checklist from that edition",{"href":"#section-6","children":"When a new call appears, rebuild the checklist from that edition"}]]}]]}],false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,["$","div",null,{"className":"article-body","children":[["$","section","What is verified, and what is still unknown",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-1","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"What is verified, and what is still unknown"}],[["$","p","DESY’s owner page describes a research placement in Hamburg or Zeuthen involving photon science, accelerators, particle physics and astroparticle physics. Its dated edition ran from 21 July to 10 September 2026. The application page says that edition is closed.",{"children":"DESY’s owner page describes a research placement in Hamburg or Zeuthen involving photon science, accelerators, particle physics and astroparticle physics. Its dated edition ran from 21 July to 10 September 2026. The application page says that edition is closed."}],["$","p","Treat these as background for deciding whether to prepare, not instructions to submit a future application. A search result carrying “2027” cannot supply an opening date absent from the owner’s call. Keep a note of the edition beside every downloaded document so an old application checklist does not become your new timetable.",{"children":"Treat these as background for deciding whether to prepare, not instructions to submit a future application. A search result carrying “2027” cannot supply an opening date absent from the owner’s call. Keep a note of the edition beside every downloaded document so an old application checklist does not become your new timetable."}]],"$undefined","$L21","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$L22","$undefined"]}]]}],"$L23",false,false,false,"$L24",false,"$L25",null]}],"$L26"]}]
