2d:I["ab32ab9b14fd",[],"TaskChecklist",1]
27:["$","p","Create a one-page inventory with four columns: course or project, date, personal contribution and evidence you can retrieve. Select two items that connect to the type of research you want to try. The purpose is to recall precise work, not to make a long attachment bundle that the future form may not request.",{"children":"Create a one-page inventory with four columns: course or project, date, personal contribution and evidence you can retrieve. Select two items that connect to the type of research you want to try. The purpose is to recall precise work, not to make a long attachment bundle that the future form may not request."}]
28:["$","p","For example, a fictional student analysing detector-like signals can record that they wrote a baseline correction, tested it on synthetic inputs and found that it failed when peaks overlapped. That bounded explanation shows more understanding than claiming to have built a complete detection system. Keep the unfinished part visible.",{"children":"For example, a fictional student analysing detector-like signals can record that they wrote a baseline correction, tested it on synthetic inputs and found that it failed when peaks overlapped. That bounded explanation shows more understanding than claiming to have built a complete detection system. Keep the unfinished part visible."}]
29:["$","$L2d",null,{"id":"internships/desy-summer-student-programme:section-3","title":"Check your progress","items":["I can explain one relevant piece of my own work without reading a script.","I separate my contribution from a team’s overall output.","I can show a limitation or check, not just a successful-looking result.","I will upload only documents requested by the new official call."]}]
2a:["$","section","3-Check enrolment continuity before assuming a summer is available",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Check enrolment continuity before assuming a summer is available"}],[["$","p","The verified 2026 conditions required at least three years of full-time university study in the relevant fields and enrolment throughout the programme. They excluded applicants who had already completed a master’s by that summer and previous DESY summer students. These are archived conditions to recheck, not a promise about the next edition.",{"children":"The verified 2026 conditions required at least three years of full-time university study in the relevant fields and enrolment throughout the programme. They excluded applicants who had already completed a master’s by that summer and previous DESY summer students. These are archived conditions to recheck, not a promise about the next edition."}],["$","p","A final-year student should draw an actual enrolment timeline. Suppose examinations end in June, a degree is formally awarded in July and a new master’s starts in September. “I intend to continue studying” may not show continuous enrolment across a summer placement. Ask the university what dates its certificate can truthfully cover, then ask DESY about the current call if a gap remains.",{"children":"A final-year student should draw an actual enrolment timeline. Suppose examinations end in June, a degree is formally awarded in July and a new master’s starts in September. “I intend to continue studying” may not show continuous enrolment across a summer placement. Ask the university what dates its certificate can truthfully cover, then ask DESY about the current call if a gap remains."}],["$","p","Do not change graduation dates or rely on an informal lecturer email to repair a formal condition. The useful outcome of this early check may be deciding to target a different research opportunity.",{"children":"Do not change graduation dates or rely on an informal lecturer email to repair a formal condition. The useful outcome of this early check may be deciding to target a different research opportunity."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://summerstudents.desy.de/conditions/",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://summerstudents.desy.de/conditions/","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"DESY: published 2026 participant conditions"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}]
2b:["$","section","4-Separate supported costs from money needed before arrival",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Separate supported costs from money needed before arrival"}],[["$","p","The 2026 main page described hostel accommodation, daily pay and at least partial travel reimbursement. Those published benefits are not a verified future package. The FAQ’s travel section still refers to earlier rules, which is another reason to wait for the new terms before calculating an entitlement.",{"children":"The 2026 main page described hostel accommodation, daily pay and at least partial travel reimbursement. Those published benefits are not a verified future package. The FAQ’s travel section still refers to earlier rules, which is another reason to wait for the new terms before calculating an entitlement."}],["$","p","Use a fictional cash-flow test instead: travel costs €480, initial personal expenses €220, and no payment arrives before departure. You need €700 accessible at that point, even if a later award reimburses part of travel. A promised reimbursement is not money available to buy the ticket. These values are illustrative, not DESY rates.",{"children":"Use a fictional cash-flow test instead: travel costs €480, initial personal expenses €220, and no payment arrives before departure. You need €700 accessible at that point, even if a later award reimburses part of travel. A promised reimbursement is not money available to buy the ticket. These values are illustrative, not DESY rates."}],["$","p","When invited, check insurance, the support period, the first payment date and any receipt requirements against the actual documents. Keep tickets and booking evidence in your own folder. Obtain the current invitation and immigration instructions before making commitments that depend on participation.",{"children":"When invited, check insurance, the support period, the first payment date and any receipt requirements against the actual documents. Keep tickets and booking evidence in your own folder. Obtain the current invitation and immigration instructions before making commitments that depend on participation."}]],"$undefined",[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Original pre-arrival cash test: fictional amounts","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Original pre-arrival cash test: fictional amounts"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Payment before arrival",{"scope":"col","children":"Payment before arrival"}],["$","th","Amount",{"scope":"col","children":"Amount"}],["$","th","Cash treatment",{"scope":"col","children":"Cash treatment"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Travel paid by student"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"€480"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Needed before any later reimbursement"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Initial personal expenses"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"€220"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Separate accessible cash"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Total before first payment"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"€700"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Does not assume reimbursement amount or date"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://summerstudents.desy.de/",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://summerstudents.desy.de/","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"DESY: last verified Summer Student Programme page"}]]}],"$L2e"]]}],"$undefined"]}]
2c:["$","section","5-When a new call appears, rebuild the checklist from that edition",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"When a new call appears, rebuild the checklist from that edition"}],[["$","p","Start with the official application page and confirm that its heading, dates and form refer to the same edition. Copy the exact deadline, time zone if supplied, participant conditions and document instructions into a fresh checklist. Mark old downloaded forms as archived rather than silently renaming their year.",{"children":"Start with the official application page and confirm that its heading, dates and form refer to the same edition. Copy the exact deadline, time zone if supplied, participant conditions and document instructions into a fresh checklist. Mark old downloaded forms as archived rather than silently renaming their year."}],["$","p","Next, compare the new conditions with your enrolment timeline and research-fit worksheet. Resolve a mandatory-condition problem before polishing the narrative. Check the permitted availability period against exams, graduation and other commitments. Finally, review every upload in the format requested and retain the submitted confirmation when you actually apply.",{"children":"Next, compare the new conditions with your enrolment timeline and research-fit worksheet. Resolve a mandatory-condition problem before polishing the narrative. Check the permitted availability period against exams, graduation and other commitments. Finally, review every upload in the format requested and retain the submitted confirmation when you actually apply."}],["$","p","Until that call is verified, a sensible finished task is one clear research example, one checked enrolment question and one official page to revisit. That preparation remains useful even if the next edition changes or a different opportunity proves a better fit.",{"children":"Until that call is verified, a sensible finished task is one clear research example, one checked enrolment question and one official page to revisit. That preparation remains useful even if the next edition changes or a different opportunity proves a better fit."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for When a new call appears, rebuild the checklist from that edition","children":[["$","$L5","/internships/",{"href":"/internships/","children":["Compare other research and internship routes",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$9:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L5","/guides/recommendation-letter/",{"href":"/guides/recommendation-letter/","children":["Prepare recommendation evidence",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$9:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L5","/tools/ects-workload-calculator/",{"href":"/tools/ects-workload-calculator/","children":["Understand workload and credits",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$9:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
